  {
    "sha": "6b2937c1267b9bcf091ed938c003fb9ba335aae4",
    "date": "2026-04-11T21:07:39Z",
    "message": "DWH3-299: Name corrections .\n\n  Typos: Scottalnd→Scotland,and  Illinnois→Illinois, Nothumbria→Northumbria,\n  Cherookee→Cherokee, Dutchy→Duchy, Zhow→Zhou, Bantou→Bantu, Papous→Papuans,\n  Khoiasan→Khoisan, Anglo-Egyption→Anglo-Egyptian, Kingfom→Kingdom.\n  Encoding: Teotihuacan, Monte Alban, Cochimi variants fixed.\n  Naming: Vice-Royalty→Viceroyalty, Expansionist Kingdom of Merina→Merina Kingdom,\n  United Provinces of La Plata→United Provinces of the Rio de la Plata,\n  Chola state→Chola Empire, Hindu Kingdoms→Hindu kingdoms.\n  39 files, 508 property values corrected.",
    "html_url": "https://github.com/aourednik/historical-basemaps/commit/6b2937c1267b9bcf091ed938c003fb9ba335aae4"
  },
